        "- **LSTM**: 4 gates — can learn long-range patterns, more parameters\n",
        "- **GRU**: 2 gates — simpler, faster, similar performance\n",
        "- **Bi-LSTM**: reads forward AND backward — better offline, NOT for live monitoring"
